# Lessons from Life ({2}{G}{U}): "Draw three cards. You may put a land card from your hand onto the battlefield tapped." Bot1 casts it on turn 1 from four Moxen.
# The three cards drawn are a Forest, an Island and a Lightning Bolt; the hand already holds a Plains. The draw comes first, so the drawn Forest is a legal choice
# (the Lightning Bolt is refused, not a land card). The Forest enters tapped and putting it is not playing it (CR 305.2): LandsPlayed stays 0, so the Island can
# still be played afterwards.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Lessons from Life
Plains
Lightning Bolt
Forest
Island
Lightning Bolt
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

